==German==

===Alternative forms===
* [[Scheisse]] {{qualifier|Switzerland}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{term|schize|schīze|lang=gmh}}, originally *{{term||schīte}}, from {{proto|Germanic|skīta-|lang=de}}, from {{proto|Indo-European|skei-d-|to part|lang=de}}. Indo-European cognates include Ancient Greek {{term|σχιστός|tr=skhistos|lang=grc|sc=polytonic}} and English {{term|shit|lang=en}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈʃaɪ̯sə/|lang=de}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|g=f|pl=-}}

# {{vulgar|lang=de}} [[faeces]], [[shit]]
#: ''Wo ich hintrete nur '''Scheiße'''!''
# {{vulgar|figuratively|lang=de}} something worthless, [[shit]]
#: ''Das ist doch alles '''Scheiße'''!''

